{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_intro_1000_p", "source_sha256": "918df0edb02dbe2d6717f07961245b8c6156f588f4c26e4f55166c96d8360ee2", "ja": "（CLEVER CLOVERの集大成ライブまで、\nあと少し！　今日はスタッフや関係者のゲネプロだ）", "zh": "（距离CLEVER CLOVER的最终公演只剩一点时间了！今天是工作人员和相关人员的总彩排）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "6996e0c1cab611ce5ec5d22e33fdb35a1417853a1131d6a15a3bd5ef1bca2f3b", "ja": "それにしても、青羽さんが戻って来ないな。\n差し入れがどうとか言ってたけど……。", "zh": "话说回来，青羽小姐还没回来啊。\n她之前好像说要准备慰问品来着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_intro_1002_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_intro_1003_president", "source_sha256": "d88674e37388958299ec3ae4f9850b126830c14a0769872730f1c7bbd78bb862", "ja": "やあ、君！　公演の差し入れの話かね？\n無論、我々も用意しているよ。音無君！", "zh": "哎呀，你来啦！是在说给公演送慰劳品的事吗？\n那是自然，我们也准备了哦。音无君！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_intro_1004_101kot", "source_sha256": "48b30846251684d6a5d564b9d9f11e5dcf007730d303e4c1db52a3fc5049613f", "ja": "はい、社長！　{$P$}さん、\nこの使い捨てのカイロ、みんなに差し入れです。", "zh": "是的，社长！{$P$}先生，这些一次性暖宝宝是给大家的慰问品。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "54d5d0bcd6207bbf8c900214e81587636231954123ea751ba0ad0f7f0a2a0715", "ja": "あっ、社長、音無さん！\nこんなにたくさん……ありがとうございます！", "zh": "啊，社长、音无小姐！  \n这么多……谢谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_intro_1006_101kot", "source_sha256": "3c9d0d6c0dc3775a7e1f39c24164b60ddf3fe855497951da071da4dd3eb2f6dc", "ja": "ツアーで余れば、劇場のみんなも使えますし。\n冬のカイロは、いくつあっても困りませんからね！", "zh": "要是巡演时有剩余，剧场的大家也能用上。\n毕竟冬天的暖宝宝，再多几个也不嫌多嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_intro_1007_president", "source_sha256": "ce6d0dca1074248f0522adb03f23be9cb2347853e56e75233d353d0051bed384", "ja": "うむ！　ゲネプロを見学ついでの差し入れだったが……\n我ながらいいチョイスをしたと自負しているよ。", "zh": "嗯！本来是顺便来参观彩排时带的慰问品，不过……\n我还是很有自信，觉得自己选得相当不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_intro_1008_101kot", "source_sha256": "6ad05552ac70ea6dc8b123a0d7b9cb441d792e685730933c9317d24cb820845e", "ja": "はい。ダイヤモンドに勝るとも劣らない、\n鮮烈なクローバーの煌めき……。", "zh": "是的。不逊于钻石的、鲜烈耀眼的三叶草光辉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_intro_1009_101kot", "source_sha256": "353bfe09c4436730e55398f3be9b13ace41dc44d24ff339fb873796f7db7c4d9", "ja": "本番でもあのクオリティを発揮してもらうために、\nこの差し入れで身も心も温まってもらわなくちゃ♪", "zh": "为了让大家在正式演出时也能发挥出那样的水准，得用这份慰问品让大家身心都暖和起来才行♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_intro_1010_p", "source_sha256": "d2493bea02569c5b19285637b49f409b3612ff6d172887a94600364367d199ff", "ja": "ですね！　ではこのカイロは責任もって、\n青羽さんとみんなに……あ。", "zh": "是啊！那我可得负起责任，把这个暖宝宝送给青羽小姐和大家……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_intro_1011_101kot", "source_sha256": "889ae666e950079a9057413ef4dc89cbca30b518897f628628a5cd0dcaea2bc1", "ja": "そういえば……さっきから、\n美咲ちゃんの姿が見当たらないわね。", "zh": "说起来……从刚才开始，就没看到美咲的身影呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_intro_1012_president", "source_sha256": "950884951598ccf985ede9ecaecb3ef8be5834322db402ecff8cfd3be85340cf", "ja": "うむ。\n……おや、噂をすれば。", "zh": "嗯。\n\n……哎呀，说到谁谁就来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_intro_1013_se", "source_sha256": "d335a178fbd7ae98d0648ab5d06d8fc395d9d5ed273ce75af53cfc4a761f95b7", "ja": "バタバタバタ……ガチャ！", "zh": "啪嗒啪嗒啪嗒……咔嗒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_intro_1014_102mis", "source_sha256": "7808d906609ca5ec74c0abeda1c07738eb9a8884fce8a830e59522a22b24b436", "ja": "す、すみません、お待たせしました！\nああっ、社長さん、音無先輩！　案内もしないで……！", "zh": "不、不好意思，让您久等了！\n啊啊，社长、音无前辈！都没来得及带您参观……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_intro_1015_101kot", "source_sha256": "bc464a551dde02124cd2d109d4ab472c8842ca561c100dae91c4d38c6ab88e9d", "ja": "あら、そんなこと気にしなくていいのよ。\nそれより……美咲ちゃん、その手に持ってるのは？", "zh": "哎呀，不用在意那种事啦。比起这个……美咲，你手里拿着的是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_intro_1016_102mis", "source_sha256": "7504add468be467e8d85152348c33e2b490aaefc45045065b9a795705fa63fa9", "ja": "あ、これは、大したものじゃないんですけど……\nその、ツアーに行くみんなを勇気づけたいなって……。", "zh": "啊，这个啊，没什么大不了的……\n就是……我想给要去巡演的大家打打气……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_intro_1017_101kot", "source_sha256": "9117df8feba4b84ec763c73ec37b5c04f70017ac627fd633037bde0a78f881bf", "ja": "まぁ、四つ葉のクローバー！？\nもしかして、劇場の裏で探してたの？", "zh": "哎呀，是四叶草！？\n难不成，你之前一直在剧场后面找这个吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_intro_1018_102mis", "source_sha256": "3c7974c73c7ee84dc15c790729f6a4144624d161752592755422071f7f20a3e6", "ja": "はい！　みんな、すっごく頑張ってましたから。\nあとは、せめて幸運を、と思って……。", "zh": "是的！大家都非常努力。\n所以我想着，至少送上这份幸运……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_intro_1019_p", "source_sha256": "850efda4ad579e928d72e3f56a496241e11e69c53b8a0cdbbfc0e83bc0e1be30", "ja": "青羽さん……ありがとうございます！　青羽さんの\n心遣いに、きっとみんな勇気づけられますよ！", "zh": "青羽小姐……谢谢您！青羽小姐的这份体贴，一定能给大家带来勇气！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "221078f544cc044a6c0eaccc93a47ec341d288b5ea225ed64c95a74e171bf0aa", "ja": "ふむ……幸運という最後のパーツが揃った以上、\n恐れるものは何もないというわけだな。", "zh": "嗯……既然幸运这一最后的零件已经凑齐了，也就是说，已经没有什么可怕的了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "73d65c01e10d3bccd2c3cacc9bdb83a2b9674f1ea0015bc99dedcfe77447d675", "ja": "集大成ライブ、期待以上のものになりそうだ。\n見事、君の手で成功へと導いてくれたまえ！", "zh": "这场集大成演唱会看来会超出预期。\n就请你亲手将它引向圆满成功吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_intro_1022_p", "source_sha256": "bbecf8f2e571eb4cd4edd2c22c883446860f225c73d7a7e347fad9efd71b6d56", "ja": "はい！　みんなの期待も乗せて……\n集大成ライブ、全力でプロデュースしてみせます！", "zh": "好的！我会带着大家的期待……\n全力制作这场集大成演唱会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
